  "ruleText": "Plc 313.04 Information Required for Initial License Application. The applicant shall identify the profession for which the application is being filed and then provide the information specified in Plc 303.04 for individuals and all applicants.\n\nSource. #13763, INTERIM, eff 10-15-23, EXPIRED: 4-12-24\n\nNew. #13954, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #1 at part heading for Plc 313)",
